      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
